{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_aglina_set_1_story_2",
  "groupId": "story_aglina_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "没写收件人的包裹",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aglina_1_2.txt",
  "sourceHash": "716d7592453e1c1250d0cd0736f598c0bcac877b8d51cc9f76f8a7218161022c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 安洁莉娜"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "这是白天我送出最后一个包裹的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是快餐店哎！我的最爱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "炸兽肉！薯条！椒盐蘑菇！哇，我全都要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "咦，那个女孩子不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "炸兽肉要几份？两份？二十份？这么多，小姑娘你一个人真吃得完吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好嘞，十份番茄酱，十串撒盐。这些给你——还有你呢，你要什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "唔......嗯......都好香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "不行，现在还不能吃宵夜。我还有正事还没做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "老板，请问傍晚坐在你店里看书的女孩子，她去了哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，你说她啊。她走啦，应该是想办法回隔壁镇上啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "连夜走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，连夜。如果再不走，可能就见不到她爸最后一面了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "诶小姑娘，你看着面熟，是不是傍晚来过一次？你就是那个给艾米丽送来消息的信使吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我......是我。不过我并不知道是那样的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，艾米丽一个人在这念书，有空的时候会来我摊上搭把手，挣点零花钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她爸爸在老家，平时每个月都会给寄信来，没想到上个月和上上个月信都没到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾米丽一直很着急，还专门去找你们信使问，是不是把信漏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "老板我们很靠谱的，一般不丢件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好好好，我信你们，艾米丽也不是不相信。但等不到家里的消息，心里总是很不安啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "难怪她傍晚看到我的时候，特别高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "只可惜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸，那句话怎么说的？天有什么风云？反正啊，是人就总会有生老病死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再说了，要不是你送来了她爸爸这最后一封信，她也不会知道自己得赶紧回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾米丽她打心眼里是想谢谢你的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "对了，你们来找她是有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "这个......现在没事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我想这东西不会是她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快餐店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好嘞，没事的话，吃的尽管点，我给你们打八折！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "不知不觉就吃了好多东西，完蛋，这个月钱又花光了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "天都快亮了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "可不是，跑了一夜！肚子确实饿了。咦，你可是一点东西都没吃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是不是还想着艾米丽的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "或许不完全是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "只是听说她的事情之后，我忍不住在想，会不会也有人一直在等我的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "对哦，安洁莉娜很久没回家了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "......如果路过也算的话，倒也不算太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎，你想好什么时候回去了吗？或者至少联系一下爸爸妈妈啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我不知道有没有做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "什么准备呀？现在安洁莉娜的病情不是挺稳定的么？当初你说不忍心关心你的人眼睁睁看着你痛苦，宁可让他们以为你失踪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "......以为我是失踪的话，哪怕过去五年、十年，也依然会有我还在某个地方好好活着的希望吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "可心里一定还是很担心啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "而且有医疗部门的大家在，别说五年十年，未来一定是光明的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "咦，那是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我好像看到了一条......不对，一、二、三......好多条毛茸茸的尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "啊，安洁莉娜姐姐，可颂姐姐，早、早上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "是小丽萨啊，早上好。欸，现在时间还很早，还没到丽萨的起床时间吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "可是......可是我想来看看那样东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "什么东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "就是，就是那个笔记......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "我昨天做完了，就想赶紧拿来给安洁莉娜姐姐看，后来太晚了，我，我不敢让凯尔希医生发现我没有按时睡觉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "但实在很想让安洁莉娜姐姐马上看到啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "所以你就把东西放在了宿舍门口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "嗯......嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "这样的话，安洁莉娜姐姐辛苦了一整天回来，看到它，一定会很开心吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎呀呀，你看安洁莉娜，这真的是送给你的包裹呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "赶紧打开看看吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "送给......我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "包装得这么仔细......是我最喜欢的粉红色。还有这个香味......也很熟悉。原来是上次去医疗部门闻到的熏香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "有、有味道吗？是我写完作业以后偷偷做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "可能会沾到一点味道吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "不讨厌哦，这个味道我也很喜欢呢。有种很安心的感觉。一、二、三，我打开啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "......里面是一本小册子啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "这，这条河......这些建筑......啊，看到了我最喜欢的咖啡店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "如果再往东边走十分钟，那条路我曾经在白天走过几百......不对，上千回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "还有，这片花瓣......这个似曾相识的味道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "花瓣是我让爸爸寄给我的哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "虽然前面都是妈妈的朋友给我寄的照片，啊，也有我自己根据记忆画下来的。怎么看都还是有点丑的样子，明明也练习了好久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "不，真的很好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "所有的东西，都很好，很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "安洁莉娜姐姐，你怎么、怎么好像不高兴？是我做错了什么吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "没有。我没有不高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我是......太高兴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "自从......以后，我再也没有见过它们白天的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我以为我早就把它们弄丢在很远的地方了......很遥远、很遥远，无论我跑得多快，都到不了的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "是呀，罗德岛确实是一艘很大——的船，又一直在到处跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "我刚来的时候，也常常会问亚叶姐姐我们现在在哪里，然后偷偷地算从这儿到叙拉古、到东国的距离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "有时候近，有时候远，后来也算不清楚啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "但每次收到来自爸爸、妈妈或者他们朋友的信，我都会偷偷抱着它们睡一觉，这样好像就又距离爸爸妈妈很近很近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "再后来，信越来越多，我如果抱着睡的话会把它们撒得满床都是......唔，所以我就把一部分放进小本子里面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "这样我就可以抱着小本子睡觉啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "嗯......丽萨真的是个很可爱的好孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "咦，是我又说什么奇怪的话了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "是说了特别正确的话呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "博士跟我说，信使姐姐们平时总要到处跑，还要负责罗德岛上的工作，真的很辛苦。我想安洁莉娜姐姐应该也很久没回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "上次博士看到我的这本笔记，夸我很厉害呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "博士说，可能安洁莉娜姐姐也很需要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "是......博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "嗯，还有其他哥哥姐姐，不光是在罗德岛工作的大家哦，也有之前给我送东西的叙拉古信使哥哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "忘了从哪一天开始，大家去叙拉古和东国的时候，都会顺手带一点照片或者特产什么的回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎呀，就跟大家都成了信使一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "对，就像厉害的信使姐姐们一样！然后我会把这些东西都保存在小本子里面，这可是我最大的宝贝之一哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "每天我都在想，等本子填满的时候，我应该就长大啦，一定会比现在厉害得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "到时候就轮到我保护大家，也可以保护爸爸妈妈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "爸爸不会再因为担心我而整晚睡不好觉，妈妈也不会因为我而一直在外面很累很累地工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "等到了那一天，我就可以回家啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "所以呀，自从博士跟我说了以后，我就决定也要给安洁莉娜姐姐做一本......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "安洁莉娜姐姐一定也是因为某个原因才没法回家的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "那说好啦，等之后有了新的照片，我也会再送一份给安洁莉娜姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "这样的话，本子会更快填满，安洁莉娜姐姐也可以早点回去了哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "谢谢。谢谢你......这真是一份很棒的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "啊，到我平时起床的时间了！可不能让凯尔希医生和亚叶姐姐发现我到处乱跑......我先走啦！安洁莉娜姐姐再见，可颂姐姐再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "早知道就和你打个赌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我就知道，安洁莉娜这么可爱的女孩子，一定会收到可爱的礼物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "嗯......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "不知不觉间，我已经是罗德岛的安洁莉娜。有人关心着的安洁莉娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "不再是那个......消失了的女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊——总觉得有点困了。安洁莉娜你刚才说什么了？我好像没听清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "没，没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我在说，我真的很喜欢丽萨的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "所以说真是充满惊喜的一夜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "现在是回去睡一觉好呢？还是吃点东西......嗯，吃点东西就好啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "安洁莉娜你呢？一整夜没睡，会影响你的美容计划的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我稍微休息一下，过会儿去训练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "下午还要继续上课......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "除了工作，学习也不能落下啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊？太夸张啦！你可别变成工作狂啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "不会的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "等本子填满的时候......就能回家了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "我是不是已经准备好了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "这封信......在桌上待了多久了？几个月？半年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "“亲爱的爸爸、妈妈——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "“......我在这里一切都好......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "“有很好的工作，也还在继续学习......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "“......是的，矿石病，但不要担心，是那天去学校路上发生的......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "“是我急着要去社团活动......是我自己拒绝了爸爸开车送我。如果我更小心一些的话，或许就不会蹭到那辆野外回来的车。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "“这一切都不是爸爸的错。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "就把信夹在这一页吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "总有一天，我会准备好，也相信爸爸妈妈会准备好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "到时候这封信就写完了，我会亲手把信送到照片上的这个地方去，对，就是这条街上东边数起的第三家，在这里画个心好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安洁莉娜",
      "speakerId": "char_291_aglina",
      "text": "......那一天，应该已经不远了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
